      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Cecile has found Gabriel at lunch and asks for news about the film. She already knows what Camille let slip earlier, but waits to hear what her agent will say. Listen to his explanation and her decision in French.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Cécile, super! Ça va?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Oui, et toi? J'ai essayé de t'appeler.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "C'est non-stop au boulot aujourd'hui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Toujours aucune nouvelle?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ah, si! J'ai eu Miranda Jones au téléphone.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Dis-moi tout.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Je ne te mens jamais, Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ils ont pensé que ce serait mieux avec un homme.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Un homme?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
