      "t": "Tu sais combien je voulais ce rôle?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Je change d'agent.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Tu es un menteur! C'est à cause de mon âge, non?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Pourquoi te donner dix pour cent si tu ne me défends pas?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Cécile, super! Ça va?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cecile, great! How are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Oui, et toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, and you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "J'ai essayé de t'appeler.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I tried to call you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "C'est non-stop au boulot aujourd'hui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's non-stop at work today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Toujours aucune nouvelle?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still no news?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ah, si! J'ai eu Miranda Jones au téléphone.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, yes! I had Miranda Jones on the phone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Dis-moi tout.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Je ne te mens jamais, Cécile.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never lie to you, Cecile.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ils ont pensé que ce serait mieux avec un homme.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They thought it would be better with a man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Un homme?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A man?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Je sais, c'est fou!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know, it's crazy!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Ça n'a rien à voir avec moi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It has nothing to do with me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Pas du tout!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Elle a dit que tu étais fantastique.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She said you were fantastic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Je sais que tu es déçue, mais on va rebondir.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know you're disappointed, but we'll bounce back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Tu sais combien je voulais ce rôle?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you know how much I wanted this part?'",
      "gap": 0.45
